  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Method support gender equality 2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Metod st&#xF6;d j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A number of strategic processes have been identified for Sida&apos;s internal work and support to the field within the thematic priority gender equality during 2012. Because of limited personnel resources, Sida will need external support in the form of shorter consultant advisory services within the working area global programmes, as well as training in the integration of gender in development results.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett antal strategiska processer har identifierats f&#xF6;r Sida&apos;s internt arbete och st&#xF6;d till f&#xE4;ltet inom det tematiska prioriteringen j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet under 2012. Med anledning av begr&#xE4;nsade personalresurser, kommer Sida att beh&#xF6;ver externt st&#xF6;d i form av kortare konsult r&#xE5;dgivning inom det globala programsverksamhet, samt tr&#xE4;ning i integration of j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet i bist&#xE5;ndsresultat.</narrative>
  </description>
